'''Master A.''' (師匠 ''Shishō'', '''Master''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

